"This prints both. Over a VPN such as Tailscale, use the address the VPN shows instead." = "这会同时显示两者。通过 Tailscale 等 VPN 时,请改用 VPN 显示的地址。";
"On this Mac: make an ssh key" = "在这台 Mac 上:创建 ssh 密钥";
"You already have one, %@, so you can skip this step." = "你已经有一个密钥(%@),可以跳过这一步。";
"Press Return at each question to keep the defaults." = "每个问题都按 Return 以保留默认值。";
"On this Mac: copy the key over" = "在这台 Mac 上:复制密钥";
"Put what step 2 printed in place of USER@ADDRESS. Type yes to trust the device, then its password, once. The password goes from Terminal to the device; Sysbar never sees it." = "把 USER@ADDRESS 换成第 2 步显示的内容。输入 yes 信任该设备,然后输入一次它的密码。密码从终端直接发送到设备,Sysbar 永远看不到。";
"On this Mac: check it" = "在这台 Mac 上:检查";
"If this returns without asking for anything, click Add device and fill in the same address and user name." = "如果命令什么都没问就结束了,点按添加设备,并填写相同的地址和用户名。";
